{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "id": "pw8-aurora-pad",
    "name": "AURORA PAD",
    "author": "Patchwork Eight Engineering",
    "description": "A brighter, glassier, more ethereal sibling to Halcyon Pad -- wider detune shimmer (ratios 0.994/1.0/1.006, a hair wider than Halcyon's) over clean sine octaves/double-octaves rather than triangle, for a more glassy than woody upper register. FLOATIER via a lighter sub (level 0.35 vs Halcyon's 0.50) and a brighter open filter (3200Hz vs 2200Hz). MOVEMENT via a wider Chorus (rate 0.5Hz, depth 8ms) plus a subtle Tape Delay (450ms, feedback 0.3, drift depth 4ms) for a slow shimmering echo trail layered under the reverb -- two independent slow-movement sources, not one doing double duty. SPACIOUS via an even bigger/airier Reverb than Halcyon's (size 2.6, decay 7s, high-ratio 0.85 so the shimmer genuinely carries into the tail, +3dB high EQ). EVOLVING via LFO1 -> FilterCutoff (deeper than Halcyon's) and a light Velocity -> FilterCutoff.",
    "category": "pad",
    "moods": ["bright", "ethereal", "inspiring", "airy", "evolving"],
    "genres": ["ambient", "score"],
    "tags": ["pad", "chorus", "shimmer", "reverb-showcase", "major-key"],
    "createdAt": "2026-08-10T00:00:00Z",
